This recent paper from @MSFTResearch demonstrates that simple sliding window attention with attention sinks matches or exceeds post-trained linear attention models on standard benchmarks while outperforming them by up to ten times on long-context reasoning without requiring any post-training. 

Read the paper with an AI tutor: https://t.co/yF3LPfaBnR

@jm_alexia luckily Microsoft lets me publish all their papers on ChapterPal despite the unusable license this paper was published under :-)

