However, I have to say that Fable 5.1 is blazingly fast and powerful at code.

For now at least you have an edge on GPT Sol and open source… a high bar has been set but the others will respond soon. These are exciting times in AI.

@heyitsyashu @sjgadler @_NathanCalvin this is not about superintelligence.

it’s about being able to properly monitor  present day techniques. 

