@GeorgeE33179 If you run such experiments without even having monitoring in place, that is called iNCOMPETENCE. 

If you say you and your "3rd party provider misunderstood" and internet access was indeed there when you ran your experiments, that is INCOMPETENCE on your part. 

But everyone eats up this propaganda because we're living in the twilight zone where lack of basic security protocols and training is used as propaganda.

